ting by humans and credited. Sounds from various non-AI sources and libraries, processed entirely without the use of AI. Spy On The Wall never has and never will use AI in any capacity for its games.</p>", "short_description": "An FPS starring your favorite platformer character Captain Moviestar… now in full three-dimensions. Early 90’s 2.5D-raycaster-style shooter for the proto-boomer set.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“It’s not that Captain Moviestar 3D is bad, it’s that it reminds me so much of a bad game that I can’t make sane judgement fairly (or convincingly)”<br />\r\nRick Crobbert's Naffshoot<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364460/22f341580c9ea2845a621c8c5cd44b940fcd7baf/header.jpg?t=1787834946", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364460/53f816d71a4681854e3718248de62fe28ca51c4a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787834946", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364460/53f816d71a4681854e3718248de62fe28ca51c4a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787834946", "website": "https://spyonthewall.net/captain-moviestar-3d/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (64-bit required)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or AMD Dual-Core at 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GPU with DirectX 11 or Vulkan 1.1 support<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> 100% DirectX compatible sound card or onboard sound</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit required)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 2.8 GHz/AMD Phenom II X4 945 3.0 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>